          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.21.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 21.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.21.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “For the kingdom of heaven is like a householder who went out early in the morning to hire laborers for his vineyard. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After agreeing with the laborers for a denarius",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The denarius was a day's wage for a laborer",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " a day, he sent them into his vineyard. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And going out about the third hour he saw others standing idle in the market place; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to them he said, ‘You go into the vineyard too, and whatever is right I will give you.’ So they went. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Going out again about the sixth hour and the ninth hour, he did the same. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And about the eleventh hour he went out and found others standing; and he said to them, ‘Why do you stand here idle all day?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said to him, ‘Because no one has hired us.’ He said to them, ‘You go into the vineyard too.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 19.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.24.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 24.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And when evening came, the owner of the vineyard said to his steward, ‘Call the laborers and pay them their wages, beginning with the last, up to the first.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when those hired about the eleventh hour came, each of them received a denarius. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now when the first came, they thought they would receive more; but each of them also received a denarius. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And on receiving it they grumbled at the householder, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saying, ‘These last worked only one hour, and you have made them equal to us who have borne the burden of the day and the scorching heat.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 22.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But he replied to one of them, ‘Friend, I am doing you no wrong; did you not agree with me for a denarius? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take what belongs to you, and go; I choose to give to this last as I give to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.6.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 6.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.7.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 7.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 15.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Am I not allowed to do what I choose with what belongs to me? Or do you begrudge my generosity?’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "is your eye evil because I am good?",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.13.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 13.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.19.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 19.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 10.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " So the last will be first, and the first last.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
